            "\n",
            "3. MAXIMUM LIKELIHOOD\n",
            "--------------------------------------------------\n",
            "Actual marks: [50, 60, 70]\n",
            "\n",
            "Model 1 predictions: [49, 61, 69]\n",
            "Model 1 squared error: 3\n",
            "\n",
